n begin="3:32.250" end="3:32.333">ゃ</span><span begin="3:32.333" end="3:32.612">な</span><span begin="3:32.612" end="3:32.750">い</span><span begin="3:32.750" end="3:32.950">で</span><span begin="3:32.950" end="3:33.148">す</span><span begin="3:33.148" end="3:33.424">か?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">其实你很想哭对吧？</span></p><p begin="3:33.639" end="3:37.266" itunes:key="L50" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:33.639" end="3:34.029">今</span><span begin="3:34.029" end="3:34.368">を</span><span begin="3:34.368" end="3:34.442">生</span><span begin="3:34.442" end="3:34.742">き</span><span begin="3:34.742" end="3:34.862">る</span><span begin="3:34.862" end="3:35.102">パ</span><span begin="3:35.102" end="3:35.316">ス</span><span begin="3:35.316" end="3:35.562">は</span><span begin="3:35.562" end="3:35.680">お</span><span begin="3:35.680" end="3:35.984">持</span><span begin="3:35.984" end="3:36.156">ち</span><span begin="3:36.156" end="3:36.362">で</span><span begin="3:36.362" end="3:36.567">す</span><span begin="3:36.567" end="3:37.266">か?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是那种活在当下的人吗？</span></p><p begin="3:37.455" end="3:40.003" itunes:key="L51" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:37.455" end="3:37.898">It&apos;s</span> <span begin="3:37.898" end="3:38.340">me</span> <span begin="3:38.606" end="3:38.716">why</span> <span begin="3:38.716" end="3:38.968">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="3:38.968" end="3:39.138">you</span> <span begin="3:39.138" end="3:39.588">kill</span> <span begin="3:39.588" end="3:40.003">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这就是我 为什么你不杀了我</span></p><p begin="3:40.376" end="3:41.764" itunes:key="L52" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:40.376" end="3:40.453">Why</span> <span begin="3:40.453" end="3:40.662">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="3:40.662" end="3:40.816">you</span> <span begin="3:40.816" end="3:41.334">kill</span> <span begin="3:41.334" end="3:41.764">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为什么你不杀了我<